{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>美國白宮周五（13日）表示，總統特朗普下周四（19日）在中國深圳出席亞太經合組織（APEC）會議期間，將在場邊與中國國家主席習近平及俄羅斯總統普京會晤。白宮發言人Olivia Wales說，特朗普已經表明，希望透過三方峰會討論全球裁減核武等議題。（法新社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T01:17:22.600582+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:39:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:46.545468+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:46.545468+00:00","content_hash":"a5b2dbbcbc39be4bf02fdf0e394ce1a94708866725adf6ad15d79fa51a268faa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}